config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: ''
    fontSize: 13px
    primaryColor: '#FFFFFF'
    primaryTextColor: '#1B2A3D'
    lineColor: '#444444'
    actorBkg: '#D6E4F0'
    actorBorder: '#2E5B8C'
    actorTextColor: '#1B2A3D'
    noteBkgColor: '#FFF2D1'
    noteBorderColor: '#8C7220'
    sequenceNumberColor: '#FFFFFF'
---
sequenceDiagram

  actor PT as Patient
  participant APP as Reaktor patient app
  participant BFF as Patient BFF
  participant CORE as Core service
  participant EHRI as EHR integration layer
  participant HIX as Chipsoft HiX
  participant LUS as Reaktor Professionals App (video session)
  participant BUS as Event bus
  participant NOT as Notification subsystem
  actor CL as ZAS clinician
  autonumber

  Note over PT,CL: Video consult lifecycle — booking → encounter creation in HiX →<br/>join → clinical content → write-back<br/>(KB Zorg op Afstand compliance: structured "care on demand" + Encounter)

  %% --- Booking ---
  PT->>APP: Tap "Book video consult"<br/>in pathway view
  APP->>BFF: GET available slots<br/>for pathway + specialism
  BFF->>EHRI: GET Slot?schedule=⟨specialism⟩
  EHRI->>HIX: GET Slot (BE FHIR profile)
  HIX-->>EHRI: Slot bundle
  EHRI-->>BFF: Available slots
  BFF-->>APP: Render slot picker
  PT->>APP: Select slot

  APP->>BFF: POST booking<br/>(slot, pathway, encounter type=video)
  BFF->>CORE: Register "care on demand" event<br/>(generated video session id, join URL)
  CORE->>EHRI: POST Appointment<br/>(video, BE profile)
  EHRI->>HIX: POST Appointment
  HIX-->>EHRI: Appointment ID
  EHRI-->>CORE: HiX Appointment ID

  CORE->>BFF: Schedule Reaktor Patient App video session<br/>(appointment_id, patient, clinician)
  BFF->>APP: Show video consult appointment<br/>+ generate join URL

  CORE->>BUS: Emit AppointmentBooked event
  par
    BUS->>NOT: Notification → patient
    NOT->>PT: Push + email + SMS<br/>"Video consult booked for ⟨date⟩.<br/>Join 5 min before via your app."
  and
  end

  %% --- Join time ---
  Note over PT,CL: At consult time (reminders fire automatically 24h and 30min before)

  PT->>APP: Tap "Join video consult"
  APP->>BFF: Initiate Video Call
  BFF-->>APP: opens Patient App video
  APP-->>PT: Render video session

  CL->>HIX: Click join link in HiX appointment<br/>(SMART-launched view)
  HIX->>LUS: SMART launch with patient + encounter context
  LUS-->>CL: Render video session<br/>(in HiX-embedded iframe)

  Note over PT,CL: Uses Reaktor Patient App for Patient Video Call<br/>And Reaktor Professionals App for the Clinician's Video call.

  PT-->>LUS: Patient joins
  CL-->>LUS: Clinician joins
  Note over LUS: Video session active<br/>(RTC, end-to-end encrypted)

  %% --- End ---
  CL->>LUS: End consult
  LUS->>CORE: Session-ended webhook<br/>(start, end, duration, participants)

  par
    CORE->>EHRI: PUT Encounter<br/>(status=finished, period,<br/>video tech recorded)
    EHRI->>HIX: PUT Encounter
  and
  CL->>LUS:Write consult report<br>(in embedded view, structured form)
  LUS->>CORE: POST consult report
  CORE->>EHRI: POST consult report
  EHRI->>HIX: Sync consult report
CORE->>EHRI: POST DocumentReference<br/>+ link to Encounter
    EHRI->>HIX: POST DocumentReference
    HIX-->>EHRI: Doc ID
  and
    CORE->>BUS: Emit EncounterClosed event
    BUS->>EHRI: Write Provenance<br/>(KB-required: who, when, tech)
    EHRI->>HIX: POST Provenance
  end

  CORE->>BUS: Emit pathway-advance event<br/>(next step activated)
  BUS->>NOT: Notify patient: next pathway step
  NOT->>PT: Push: "Your consult is complete.<br/>Next: take a measurement tomorrow."



  Note over PT,CL: All KB Zorg op Afstand and RIZIV-required artefacts are now in HiX:<br/>Encounter (with tech), DocumentReference (the consult report),<br/>Provenance (audit), and the structured care-on-demand event.